    "text": "Two cars are travelling towards each other at speed of $20 \\mathrm{~m} \\mathrm{~s}^{-1}$ each. When the cars are $300 \\mathrm{~m}$ apart, both the drivers apply brakes and the cars retard at the rate of $2 \\mathrm{~m} \\mathrm{~s}^{-2}$. The distance between them when they come to rest is :",
